<article class="env-lemma" id="277606">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/277606">Lemma <span data-tag="277606">2.1.2.4</span> <span class="named">(Joyal)</span>.</a> Let $f: A_0 \rightarrow A$ and $g: B_0 \rightarrow B$ be inclusions of simplicial sets. Suppose that $f$ is left anodyne. Then the induced inclusion </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  (A_0 \star B) \coprod _{ A_0 \star B_0 } (A \star B_0) \subseteq A \star B \]
</div>
  <p> is left anodyne. </p>
</article>